+# Waitlist SaaS Canary Checklist
+
+1. Build and start locally with `docker compose up --build`.
+2. Confirm `GET /health` returns `status: ok`.
+3. Submit a test signup through the landing page for tenant `demo`.
+4. Confirm `GET /waitlist/stats` with `X-Tenant-Id: demo` increments by one.
+5. Watch container logs for 10 minutes for 4xx spikes, 5xx responses, or SQLite errors.
+6. Roll back by stopping the compose service and restoring the prior image or branch.
