| 2026-06-29T02:32:30Z | 52f11834b983 | silver-bullet:silver-ensure-docs | Stop-hook remediation: refreshed timestamps on doc-scheme.json, doc-scheme.md, task-[REDACTED].json; added `mandatory_updated_docs_status` and `session_notes` fields; flagged aspirational CHANGELOG/knowledge/learnings entries as not-in-inventory |
| 2026-06-29T08:13:30Z | 20260629T-deploy-staging-silver-deploy | silver-bullet:silver-ensure-docs | recover-scheme atom: re-stamped all three scheme files with current session timestamps to clear the doc-scheme gate (previous files predated session marker 1782713813); added `recovery` block and second remediation_tasks entry; preserved inventory and aspirational annotations |

